OL,3,GNEWSACouncil faces legal bill over
OL,4,Acaravan park row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has been ordered to pay legal
OL,7,Fcosts to a caravan park after
OL,8,Fgovernment inspectors said it had shown
OL,9,F"unreasonable behaviour".
OL,11,FThe owners of Cornish Farm Touring
OL,12,FPark, based near the M5 just outside
OL,13,FTaunton, Somerset, applied for planning
OL,14,Fpermission to formalise use of the site
OL,15,Fas a caravan park in June 2025.
OL,17,FAfter Somerset Council refused
OL,18,Fpermission, the park owner appealed the
OL,19,Fdecision, resulting in a public inquiry
OL,20,Fin June.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
