OL,3,GNEWSACouncil faces legal bill over
OL,4,Acaravan park row
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanning inspector Roy Curnow ruled
OL,7,Fagainst the council and ordered it to
OL,8,Fpay the caravan park's legal costs due
OL,9,Fto "unreasonable behaviour" during the
OL,10,Fappeal process.
